WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:11.310
The North Star comes out after dark.

2
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:19.920
If we drive our car at night, we can see the North Star.

3
00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:29.030
If we sit on our porch at night, we can see the North Star.

4
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:37.149
If we walk in the park at night, we can see the North Star.

5
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:47.140
If we visit our turtle after dark, we can see the North Star.

6
00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:56.610
If we sit by the river after dark, we can see the North Star.

7
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:05.840
If we climb the ladder to the roof, we can see the North Star.

8
00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:12.020
Even our dog can see the North Star!

